{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"警方拘34歲男子　涉石峽尾公園貓糧混老鼠藥\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-24-13-18-51jTtPADiX.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】警方拘捕一名34歲男子，涉嫌在石峽尾公園將老鼠藥混入貓糧中。</p><p>片段所見，貓糧被黑色的老鼠藥覆蓋，現場是石峽尾公園近網球場一個空地。</p><p>警方凌晨接報，懷疑有人將毒餌放進貓糧，隨後在該名男子身上搜獲一包懷疑鼠餌及一把長約14厘米生果刀，以殘酷對待動物及管有攻擊性武器拘捕他，扣留調查。事件中未發現有貓隻受傷。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:41:24.906348+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:05:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T14:50:36.668977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:11.348392+00:00","content_hash":"8f7826f8186ada105d5e173c53851e9a00083e57236a99aff39349f029cb6b3d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:41:24.906348+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}